{:edb/db-before-t 1811 :edb/db-after-t 1812 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535124 50 #inst "2026-10-08T17:27:40.811Z" 13194139535124 true] [17592186068523 1100 "Determine the quotient and remainder of $6x^3-x^2+3x+1$ divided by $3x^2+x+2$." 13194139535124 false] [17592186068523 1100 "Determine the quotient and remainder of $6x^3-x^2+3x+1$ divided by $3x^2+x+2.$" 13194139535124 true] [17592186068523 1145 "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n3x^{2} + x + 22x - 1; 3x^{2} + x + 26x^{3} - 0x^{2} + 3x + 1; 3x^{2} + x + 26x^{3} + 2x^{2} + 4x_(―); 3x^{2} + x + 26x^{3} - 3x^{2} - 0x + 1; 3x^{2} + x + 26x^{3}- 3x^{2} - 0x - 2_(―); 3x^{2} + x + 26x^{3} - 3x^{2} - x +3\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n- the quotient is ${\\color{blue}2x-1}$, and\n- the remainder is ${\\color{red}3}$." 13194139535124 false] [17592186068523 1145 "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x-1 \\\\  & 3{x}^{2}+x+2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,6{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}+3x+1\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{6{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}+4x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-3{x}^{2}-x+1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,3{x}^{2}-x-2}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is ${\\color{blue}2x-1},$ and\n\n- the remainder is ${\\color{red}3}.$" 13194139535124 true] [17592186068524 1100 "Find the quotient and remainder of the following division problem:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{2x^4 - 7x^2 - x + 8}{x^2 - 1}\n$$" 13194139535124 true] [17592186068524 1100 "Find the quotient and remainder of the following division problem:\n\n$\\dfrac{2x^4 - 7x^2 - x + 8}{x^2 - 1}$" 13194139535124 false] [17592186068524 1145 "Notice that the dividend is missing the $x^3$ term. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing term with a coefficient of zero, as follows:\n\n$$\n2x^4-7x^2-x+8 = 2x^4+{\\color{red}0}x^3-7x^2-x+8\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2{x}^{2}-5 \\\\  & {x}^{2}-1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,2{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}-7{x}^{2}-x+8\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-5{x}^{2}-x+8 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,5{x}^{2}+0x+5}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-x+3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, \n\n- the quotient is ${2x^2 - 5},$ and\n\n- the remainder is ${-x+3}.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{2x^4 - 7x^2 - x +8}{x^2 - 1} \n= \n2x^2-5 + \\dfrac{-x+3}{x^2-1}.\n$$\n\nWe can rewrite this result as follows:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{2x^4 - 7x^2 - x +8}{x^2 - 1} \n= \n2x^2-5 - \\dfrac{x-3}{x^2-1}\n$$" 13194139535124 true] [17592186068524 1145 "Notice that the dividend is missing the $x^3$ term. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing term with a coefficient of zero, as follows:\n\n$$\n2x^4-7x^2-x+8 = 2x^4+{\\color{red}0}x^3-7x^2-x+8\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\nx^{2} - 12x^{2} - 5; x^{2} - 12x^{4} + 0x^{3} - 7x^{2} - 0x + 8; x^{2} - 12x^{4} + 0x^{3} - 2x^{2}_(―); x^{2} - 12x^{4} + 0x^{3} - 5x^{2} - 0x + 8; x^{2} - 12x^{4} + 0x^{3}- 5x^{2} + 0x + 5_(―); x^{2} - 12x^{4} + 0x^{3} - 5x^{2}- 0x + 3\n$$\n\nAs a result,\n\n- the quotient is ${2x^2 - 5}$, and\n- the remainder is ${-x+3}$.\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{2x^4 - 7x^2 - x +8}{x^2 - 1} = 2x^2-5 + \\dfrac{-x+3}{x^2-1}\n$$\n\nWe can rewrite this result as follows:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{2x^4 - 7x^2 - x +8}{x^2 - 1} = 2x^2-5 - \\dfrac{x-3}{x^2-1}\n$$" 13194139535124 false] [17592186068584 1100 "Find the quotient and remainder of the following division problem:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac {5x^4- 2x^3 - 18x^2 + 11x - 13} {5x^2-2x+2}\n$$" 13194139535124 true] [17592186068584 1100 "Find the quotient and remainder of the following division problem:\n$\\dfrac {5x^4- 2x^3 - 18x^2 + 11x - 13} {5x^2-2x+2}$" 13194139535124 false] [17592186068584 1145 "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n5x^{2} - 2x + 2x^{2} - 4; 5x^{2} - 2x + 25x^{4} - 2x^{3} - 18x^{2} + 11x - 13; 5x^{2} - 2x + 25x^{4} - 2x^{3} + 02x^{2}_(―); 5x^{2} - 2x + 25x^{4} - 2x^{3} - 20x^{2} + 11x - 13; 5x^{2} - 2x + 25x^{4} - 2x^{3}- 20x^{2} + 08x - 08_(―); 5x^{2} - 2x + 25x^{4} - 2x^{3} - 20x^{2} +03x - 05\n$$\n\nAs a result,\n\n- the quotient is $x^2-4$, and\n- the remainder is $3x-5$.\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{5x^4-2x^3-18x^2+11x-13}{5x^2-2x+2}=x^2-4 + \\dfrac{3x-5}{5x^2-2x+2}\n$$" 13194139535124 false] [17592186068584 1145 "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{2}-4 \\\\  & 5{x}^{2}-2x+2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,5{x}^{4}-2{x}^{3}-18{x}^{2}+11x-13\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{5{x}^{4}-2{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-20{x}^{2}+11x-13 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,20{x}^{2}+8x-8}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3x-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result,\n\n- the quotient is $x^2-4,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $3x-5.$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\dfrac{5x^4-2x^3-18x^2+11x-13}{5x^2-2x+2}=x^2-4 + \\dfrac{3x-5}{5x^2-2x+2}.\n$$" 13194139535124 true] [17592186068689 1020 #edb/ref 17592186332383 13194139535124 true] [17592186068689 1020 #edb/ref 17592186332390 13194139535124 true] [17592186068689 1020 #edb/ref 17592186332393 13194139535124 true] [17592186068689 1020 #edb/ref 17592186332397 13194139535124 true] [17592186068689 1020 #edb/ref 17592186332418 13194139535124 true] [17592186068690 1020 #edb/ref 17592186332369 13194139535124 true] [17592186068690 1020 #edb/ref 17592186332376 13194139535124 true] [17592186068690 1020 #edb/ref 17592186332413 13194139535124 true] [17592186068690 1020 #edb/ref 17592186332425 13194139535124 true] [17592186068690 1020 #edb/ref 17592186332432 13194139535124 true] [17592186068745 1020 #edb/ref 17592186332362 13194139535124 true] [17592186068745 1020 #edb/ref 17592186332403 13194139535124 true] [17592186068745 1020 #edb/ref 17592186332407 13194139535124 true] [17592186068745 1020 #edb/ref 17592186332410 13194139535124 true] [17592186068936 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535124 true] [17592186068936 1100 "$\\frac{8{x}^{4}-4{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}+4x-3}{2{x}^{2}-x+2}=$" 13194139535124 true] [17592186068936 1100 "What is $\\frac{8x^{4} - 4x^{3} + 6x^{2} + 4x - 3}{2x^{2} - x + 2}$?" 13194139535124 false] [17592186068936 1145 "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,4{x}^{2}-1 \\\\  & 2{x}^{2}-x+2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,8{x}^{4}-4{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}+4x-3\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{8{x}^{4}-4{x}^{3}+8{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2{x}^{2}+4x-3 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,2{x}^{2}+x-2}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3x-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result,\n\n- the quotient is $4{x}^{2}-1,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $3x-1.$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\frac{8{x}^{4}-4{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}+4x-3}{2{x}^{2}-x+2}=4{x}^{2}-1+\\frac{3x-1}{2{x}^{2}-x+2}.\n$$" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332362 1017 #edb/ref 17592186332363 13194139535124 true] [17592186332362 1089 "q-105622" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332362 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535124 true] [17592186332362 1100 "$\\frac{{x}^{4}+3{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}-5x+4}{{x}^{2}+2x-1}=$" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332362 1113 #uuid "ec17f389-fe0a-5d1c-9e7c-be90d254ed08" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332362 1145 "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{2}+x-2 \\\\  & {x}^{2}+2x-1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,{x}^{4}+3{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}-5x+4\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{4}+2{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}-5x+4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}-x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2{x}^{2}-4x+4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,2{x}^{2}-4x+2}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result,\n\n- the quotient is ${x}^{2}+x-2,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $2.$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{4}+3{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}-5x+4}{{x}^{2}+2x-1}={x}^{2}+x-2+\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}+2x-1}.\n$$" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332363 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332364 13194139535124 true] [17592186332363 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332365 13194139535124 true] [17592186332363 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332366 13194139535124 true] [17592186332363 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332367 13194139535124 true] [17592186332363 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332368 13194139535124 true] [17592186332363 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535124 true] [17592186332363 1041 "selection" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332363 1104 #edb/ref 17592186332365 13194139535124 true] [17592186332363 1110 #uuid "4f658c14-23c6-5a76-ba10-b5d102290b97" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332364 1034 "{x}^{2}+x+1+\\frac{5}{{x}^{2}+2x-1}" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332364 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535124 true] [17592186332364 1111 #uuid "fddc2450-9a62-5050-90cb-ef492b8bb913" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332365 1034 "{x}^{2}+x-2+\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}+2x-1}" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332365 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535124 true] [17592186332365 1111 #uuid "38ba2d25-8228-52af-80a2-a9bcf07df3ff" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332366 1034 "{x}^{2}+2x-1+\\frac{4}{{x}^{2}+2x-1}" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332366 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535124 true] [17592186332366 1111 #uuid "e893dfd1-71fd-55cd-87c3-78bf1fe1359e" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332367 1034 "{x}^{2}-2+\\frac{x+2}{{x}^{2}+2x-1}" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332367 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535124 true] [17592186332367 1111 #uuid "1add4e1f-b959-5a70-b23a-aef9835c4a85" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332368 1034 "{x}^{2}+x-1+\\frac{6}{{x}^{2}+2x-1}" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332368 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535124 true] [17592186332368 1111 #uuid "a7405a4d-5361-55f2-a9aa-d7c0e851a45d" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332369 1017 #edb/ref 17592186332370 13194139535124 true] [17592186332369 1089 "q-114512" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332369 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535124 true] [17592186332369 1100 "What is the quotient of $2{x}^{4}-{x}^{2}-1$ divided by $2{x}^{2}+1?$" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332369 1113 #uuid "b35b2265-3e78-513b-9a0a-cb0d61ba91a0" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332369 1145 "Notice that the dividend is missing the ${x}^{3}$ and $x$ terms. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing terms with zero coefficients, as follows:\n\n$$\n2{x}^{4}-{x}^{2}-1=2{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}+0x-1\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{2}-1 \\\\  & 2{x}^{2}+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,2{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}+0x-1\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,2{x}^{2}+0x-1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,\\,2{x}^{2}+0x-1}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is ${x}^{2}-1,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $0.$" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332370 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332371 13194139535124 true] [17592186332370 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332372 13194139535124 true] [17592186332370 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332373 13194139535124 true] [17592186332370 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332374 13194139535124 true] [17592186332370 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332375 13194139535124 true] [17592186332370 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535124 true] [17592186332370 1041 "selection" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332370 1104 #edb/ref 17592186332371 13194139535124 true] [17592186332370 1110 #uuid "98b9dfc4-17af-5db0-a6d4-6e21bc8bc6b7" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332371 1034 "{x}^{2}-1" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332371 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535124 true] [17592186332371 1111 #uuid "ec912811-c290-50ff-bb92-3d56aee8f564" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332372 1034 "{x}^{2}-x-2" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332372 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535124 true] [17592186332372 1111 #uuid "a5fa8784-6b38-56a8-a34e-5e6834948b4d" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332373 1034 "{x}^{2}-2x+1" 1