f-57d5-81a7-e7710c89994d" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332393 1145 "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,5x+2 \\\\  & 3{x}^{2}-x-4\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,15{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}-15x-11\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{15{x}^{3}-5{x}^{2}-20x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,6{x}^{2}+5x-11 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{6{x}^{2}-2x-8}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,7x-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n- the quotient is $5x+2,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $7x-3.$" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332394 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332395 13194139535124 true] [17592186332394 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332396 13194139535124 true] [17592186332394 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535124 true] [17592186332394 1041 "field-1" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332394 1104 #edb/ref 17592186332395 13194139535124 true] [17592186332394 1110 #uuid "76542916-e168-59c9-bf1d-92337d5236c7" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332395 1034 "5x+2" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332395 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535124 true] [17592186332395 1111 #uuid "ca823c52-4f3b-5654-a8ed-31d614c68eb3" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332396 1034 "5x-2" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332396 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535124 true] [17592186332396 1111 #uuid "015be16e-c775-5a1e-999a-91d0e96d5f54" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332397 1017 #edb/ref 17592186332398 13194139535124 true] [17592186332397 1017 #edb/ref 17592186332401 13194139535124 true] [17592186332397 1089 "q-322774" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332397 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535124 true] [17592186332397 1100 "Express $\\frac{12{x}^{3}-20x+96}{2{x}^{2}-3x+5}$ in the form $q(x)+\\frac{r(x)}{2{x}^{2}-3x+5},$ where $q(x)$ is the quotient and $r(x)$ is the reminder of the division.$$\n\n| $12{x}^{3}-20x+96$ | __ | {{field-1}} | $+$ | {{field-2}} |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $2{x}^{2}-3x+5$ | __ |  |  | $2{x}^{2}-3x+5$ |" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332397 1113 #uuid "6639b2e5-2f9c-5f64-b3b7-e42552880417" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332397 1145 "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,6x+9 \\\\  & 2{x}^{2}-3x+5\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,12{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}-20x+96\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{12{x}^{3}-18{x}^{2}+30x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,18{x}^{2}-50x+96 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,\\,18{x}^{2}-27x+45}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-23x+51\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, \n\n- the quotient is $6x+9,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $-23x+51.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{12{x}^{3}-20x+96}{2{x}^{2}-3x+5}=6x+9+\\frac{(-23x+51)}{2{x}^{2}-3x+5}.\n$$" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332398 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332399 13194139535124 true] [17592186332398 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332400 13194139535124 true] [17592186332398 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535124 true] [17592186332398 1041 "field-1" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332398 1104 #edb/ref 17592186332399 13194139535124 true] [17592186332398 1110 #uuid "3de2f2fb-4ca4-5b83-b4ae-1b924d5f9434" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332399 1034 "6x+9" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332399 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535124 true] [17592186332399 1111 #uuid "e8604eba-c9e7-5cd2-8ab0-529621f705e7" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332400 1034 "6x-9" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332400 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535124 true] [17592186332400 1111 #uuid "94e09203-9d53-5398-b773-9b155580bd53" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332401 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332402 13194139535124 true] [17592186332401 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535124 true] [17592186332401 1041 "field-2" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332401 1104 #edb/ref 17592186332402 13194139535124 true] [17592186332401 1110 #uuid "5736db50-737b-54c9-bb0f-d6a0565c3dbe" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332402 1034 "-23x+51" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332402 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535124 true] [17592186332402 1111 #uuid "ca0cc602-5387-53ff-99