}^{4}+0{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}+0x+2\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{4}+{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x+2 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}-x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{2}+x+2 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{2}+x+1}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is ${x}^{2}-x+1,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $1.$" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332433 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332434 13194139535124 true] [17592186332433 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332435 13194139535124 true] [17592186332433 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332436 13194139535124 true] [17592186332433 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332437 13194139535124 true] [17592186332433 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332438 13194139535124 true] [17592186332433 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535124 true] [17592186332433 1041 "selection" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332433 1104 #edb/ref 17592186332436 13194139535124 true] [17592186332433 1110 #uuid "10a5bfbf-75ee-5817-a38b-7a47a7ca813d" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332434 1034 "-x+3" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332434 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535124 true] [17592186332434 1111 #uuid "867d9c7b-8ec6-5a46-a9d5-126820556a2f" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332435 1034 "x-1" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332435 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535124 true] [17592186332435 1111 #uuid "a406be51-bc25-5877-aa21-4a75ac2429e1" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332436 1034 "1" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332436 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535124 true] [17592186332436 1111 #uuid "c3c2068f-becf-559b-93be-bbf555fcb6bc" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332437 1034 "2x+1" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332437 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535124 true] [17592186332437 1111 #uuid "999217be-4a56-5e1a-9f2e-ff65ee21c06c" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332438 1034 "{x}^{2}-x" 13194139535124 true] [17592186332438 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535124 true] [17592186332438 1111 #uuid "b84ed13f-9c8f-5b